# The web client's build, copied in for the server to host. Built, never edited.
apps/server/src/Foxfire.Api/wwwroot/

# The changelog section the release workflow cuts out for a build: the Release
# body, and the patch notes built into latest.yml. Written from CHANGELOG.md
# every time, so a copy left behind by a local build is never worth committing.
apps/desktop/notes.md

# Rider output
**/**/.idea/
# Local compose tweaks — publishing the database to the host, and so on.
docker-compose.override.yml
